    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39257" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prūrīgo</span></b> ,
		ĭnis, f.
		prurio. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>An itching</i>, <i>the itch</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Cels. 2,
				8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 23, 8, 80, § 154</span></i>
			(al. porriginem); 25, 11, 87, § 136; 27, 4, 5, §
			18; <i><span class="en">Mart. 14, 23,
			1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A lecherous itching</i>, <i>lasciviousness</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart. 4, 48, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11, 73, 3</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Aus. Epigr. 108, 5</span></i>.</div>
